meta {
  name: 10 Downloads
  seq: 10
}

docs {
  What clients download to play music offline. Run **3 Library** first: these requests use the track, album and artist it found (`trackId`, `albumIri`, `artistIri`). **Download album** remembers the URL of its first file (`downloadUrl`) for **Download a file**.

  `format=original` gives the files as they are; `format=opus` gives FLAC tracks converted to Opus (about a quarter of the size), e.g. while the client saves data. URLs are valid a day.
}
